# The open-findings ledger accumulates per run and per machine: every
# `rhre patterns sweep` rewrites it, and at n = 5000 it is half a megabyte of
# universes and witness lists. The durable research decisions are in
# `pattern_noise.json`, which IS tracked -- a noise rule is a judgement somebody
# made once and it must not be lost. The ledger is regenerable by re-running the
# sweep.
research_state/pattern_open.json
